   2++7AC0              ; PROJECT126 — selected SYSBIOS loader
   3++7AC0              ;
   4++7AC0              ; Selection is made in the ATM catalogue. TR-DOS access is restored using
   5++7AC0              ; the same pre-video mapping as initial startup; the chosen 8 KiB .C file is
   6++7AC0              ; staged in page 0, then sent as ABI 1.0 IMAGE BEGIN/FRAGMENT/FINISH frames.
